OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fisolated showers through the evening
OL,7,Fand overnight, though likely drier
OL,8,Fafter midnight. Brisk easterly winds
OL,9,Fcontinuing, especially for coastal
OL,10,Fparts. Chilly in places.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FLargely cloudy through the
OL,13,Fmorning, but remaining mostly dry.
OL,14,FSome sunny spells possible in the
OL,15,Fafternoon in the far southeast.
OL,16,FEasterly winds easing. Temperatures
OL,17,Fnear normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
